The comment classifier in `src/filters.rs` — the justification allow-list
(license header, generated file, public-API doc, non-obvious intent,
attribution) and the code-smell kind labels (`commented-out-code`,
`vacuous-todo`) — is a reimplementation of, and derived from reading, the
classifier tables and predicates in that project's `src/classify.rs`.

That upstream project ships no NOTICE file; this file records the attribution
obligation. The Apache-2.0 license text is available at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The evaluation corpus in `eval/sf-corpus/corpus.json` is copied from that
project's `eval/corpus.json` at commit 44e1c87 (Apache-2.0); see
`eval/sf-corpus/README.md` for the pinned commit and the kind mapping.
